                <pb facs="0740" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1877app/pg6"/>

                <head>[Inclosure 2 in No. 199.—Translation.]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[From El Industrial of Buenos Ayres.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">AMERICAN ZOLLYEREIN.</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">projection—our commerce with the
                        united states.</hi></p>
                <p>We publish below an interesting document, in which the advantages of protection
                    are shown, and in which it is defended by Mr. Evarts, minister of foreign
                    relations of the great republic. This document furnishes the best evidence of
                    the advantages of the protective system among young nations. The United States
                    are giving us a lesson by which we ought to profit. We recommend its perusal on
                    account of the data which it contains and the harmony of the views therein
                    expressed with our own.</p>


                <xi:include href="d3-a2-a1.xml" xpointer="d3-a2-a1"/>
